<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ============================================================================
  RM_GreySeaShoreScatter_Register.xml  TerminalBiomes · authored 2026-09-26
  ============================================================================
  GREYSEA_SHORE_MUTATOR_SPECIFICS_1 — the registration half.
  RM_GreySeaShoreScatter.xml declares RM_GreySeaScatterShoreDomes; a
  GenStepDef on its own runs on NO map. This file lists it.

  SCOPE (MAPGEN_SCATTER_NRE_1, 2026-09-30): the shore domes stand on a LAND
  map beside the Grey Sea, so the map's own biome cannot gate them. The
  terrain they need (RM_SaltCrustShore, tag RM_GreySaltCrust) is laid only by
  the RM_SeaCoast tile mutator (mandrake.rm.seashores) reading RM_GreySea's
  shore data — so the step is listed on RM_SeaCoast's extraGenSteps, which
  Verse.MapGenerator appends only on tiles carrying that mutator (decompiled
  1.6, MapGenerator.cs). It used to sit on the global Base_Player genSteps
  and logged "could not find cell" on every player map. Beside one of the
  other three modded seas the tag validator still finds nothing, and
  warnOnFail is false on the step for exactly that case.

  ⛔ Do NOT also add this to the sea-dive generators. These are the domes
  ABOVE the waterline; the floor's own domes are RM_SaltDome, placed by
  RM_GreySeaScatterDomes, and the two are different defs on purpose (the
  shore one yields nothing — RULED, no harvestable shore salt).

  Nested Conditionals: skip if RM_SeaCoast is not loaded; append to an
  existing extraGenSteps node, else create one.
  ============================================================================
-->
<Patch>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/TileMutatorDef[defName="RM_SeaCoast"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationConditional">
      <xpath>/Defs/TileMutatorDef[defName="RM_SeaCoast"]/extraGenSteps</xpath>
      <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
        <xpath>/Defs/TileMutatorDef[defName="RM_SeaCoast"]/extraGenSteps</xpath>
        <value>
          <li>RM_GreySeaScatterShoreDomes</li>
        </value>
      </match>
      <nomatch Class="PatchOperationAdd">
        <xpath>/Defs/TileMutatorDef[defName="RM_SeaCoast"]</xpath>
        <value>
          <extraGenSteps>
            <li>RM_GreySeaScatterShoreDomes</li>
          </extraGenSteps>
        </value>
      </nomatch>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
